{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD WITHOUT PURRS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a city that is gray, quiet, and endlessly sad. Why? Because there are <strong>NO</strong> cats. Not a single whisker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But with a magical cauldron bubbling in your van, everything changes. Bring warmth, color, and fuzzy friends back to the people. Welcome to Cat Craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make the world a better place - CRAFT.MORE.CATS</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CRAFT UNIQUE CATS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process magical flowers and fruits in your cauldron to bring one-of-a-kind fluffy companions to life. Your garden harvest determines everything - from breed and colors to unique personality quirks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/c197954ceb4153725384331b23d90d2e.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/c197954ceb4153725384331b23d90d2e.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/c197954ceb4153725384331b23d90d2e.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GARDENING &amp; ALCHEMY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate rare plants like &quot;Meow-roots&quot; in your greenhouse by carefully watering and fertilizing them. Following the right recipe with your fresh harvest is the key to crafting the specific cat you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/bc1aa9532314567222192cd82ffa7be6.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/bc1aa9532314567222192cd82ffa7be6.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/bc1aa9532314567222192cd82ffa7be6.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR CAT CAF\u00c9</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome townsfolk to your cozy caf\u00e9 and match the right cat\u2019s personality to their mood for extra rewards. Every happy customer helps fade the city's grayness, bringing color and joy back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/5446b26f311fcf8f70a0d602bae82441.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/5446b26f311fcf8f70a0d602bae82441.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/5446b26f311fcf8f70a0d602bae82441.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CAT LIBRARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your favorite cats, give them names, and upgrade your space to house up to 100 fluffy friends! Brush their fur, feed them treats, and buy toys to create the ultimate cozy paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in your van to deliver custom-crafted cats directly to your clients' homes. Grateful customers will reward you with permanent access to special seeds and new recipes from their area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Add <strong>CatCraft</strong> to your wishlist and follow us to get updates, sneak peeks, and dev diaries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942220?t=1772531047","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3942220?t=1772531047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/fb647ec3f977fb88672b362fa8605187834d8ae8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772531047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/