upgrade your space to house up to 100 fluffy friends! Brush their fur, feed them treats, and buy toys to create the ultimate cozy paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/edb193eca959c36d331f0c108b8e5eee.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND YOUR WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop in your van to deliver custom-crafted cats directly to your clients' homes. Grateful customers will reward you with permanent access to special seeds and new recipes from their area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.poster.avif?t=1772531047\" width=890 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.webm?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942220/extras/7f73048c72e918aca71702298f5bcbef.mp4?t=1772531047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Add <strong>CatCraft</strong> to your wishlist and follow us to get updates, sneak peeks, and dev diaries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Rhea Games"],"genr