66591b856c13.600x338.jpg?t=1772531047"}],"short_description":"A cozy first-person sim blending Gardening and Alchemy. Grow magical crops and mix ingredients to craft endless unique cats. Manage your Cat Caf\u00e9, find homes for your cats, and bring warmth, colors, and love back to the Gray world. From fluffy tails to quirky personalities, every cat is unique.Meow!","steam_appid":3942220,"support_info":{"email":"info@rhea.games","url":"https://rhea.games/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://rhea.games/"}